        "interpreter_and_packages": "the Python interpreter, its standard library and third-party packages (scipy on the analysis path; openpyxl and sentence_transformers on optional paths) are not pinned by this certificate. Their effect is bounded by CI, which replays every page on a fresh install and refuses a byte difference; it is not bounded by a digest here.",
